Subject: [PATCH] feat(agentkit): add Bursar action provider

Lets an agent spend from a Bursar mandate on Robinhood Chain: inspect, quote, pay and settlements. The wallet provider AgentKit holds is the mandate's agent; it signs, and the mandate pays inside limits the contract enforces.
